{
  "note": "Frozen wire examples of the long-poll response metadata (revision 3 section 3). Responses are JSON values: member order is not significant; Go emits existing members first, then status, then waitedMs. Proof hex is real, from the golden fixtures. waitedMs values are illustrative; the contract is presence, type (non-negative integer) and placement. A0 only reserves the request field: no server emits these yet.",
